    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to step into the neon-lit nights of the 1980s?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the Disco Lights places you at the heart of a retro disco bar in a first-person, atmospheric, and story-driven management simulation. Read your customers' moods, prepare drinks, keep the bar running \u2014 but remember, every choice can lead to unexpected consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported by realistic lighting, emission effects, and a period-authentic soundtrack, this immersive experience invites you into a timeless night.<br>Behind the bar, it\u2019s not just drinks that flow \u2014 secrets do, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This game contains depictions of alcohol and tobacco use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1980s-themed disco bar atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich storytelling and character interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bar management, time and resource control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive customer behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals with real-time lighting and emission effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with the spirit of indie craftsmanship</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to step into the neon-lit nights of the 1980s?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the Disco Lights places you at the heart of a retro disco bar in a first-person, atmospheric, and story-driven management simulation. Read your customers' moods, prepare drinks, keep the bar running \u2014 but remember, every choice can lead to unexpected consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported by realistic lighting, emission effects, and a period-authentic soundtrack, this immersive experience invites you into a timeless night.<br>Behind the bar, it\u2019s not just drinks that flow \u2014 secrets do, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This game contains depictions of alcohol and tobacco use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1980s-themed disco bar atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich storytelling and character interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bar management, time and resource control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive customer behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals with real-time lighting and emission effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with the spirit of indie craftsmanship</p></li></ul>",
